[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i58"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"走出家门后，看到天善正蹲坐在门前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你、你这是怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“岛上的大人们在找你呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是吗？你是来通知我的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我这种人，也只能做做跑腿这种事了……哈哈哈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“球拍……得赶快拿回来才行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的天善……真让人目不忍视。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我被叫去了村公所。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到那边的时候，周围已经聚起了许多大人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在他们中心，立着一块陌生的告示牌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘鸟白岛儿童叛乱对策总部’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"告示牌上是这么写的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原也来了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，这是怎么回事？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i272"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15031"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13303"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10159"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"少年团的成员似乎也都到齐了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连白羽都难得地出现了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“既然孩子们打算反抗，作为大人就要全力应对，于是就设立了对策总部。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“太不像话了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不禁感觉，就是因为大人这幅样子，小孩子们才要反抗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……闻闻。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么一股酒味？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细一看，总部露天摆放的长桌上还摆着一排酒瓶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“哈哈哈哈！我们大人怎么能输给一群小孩子呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“我们小时候照着村公所发射烟花，结果被罚打扫了一个月的厕所啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“对对！台风天跑去灯塔，结果差点被浪卷走，被骂得那叫一个狗血淋头！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来有几个人已经喝高了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一大早就喝酒……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11885"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“他们好像借酒聊起了小时候闯的祸。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是有其父必有其子啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这种事情想太多反而显得很蠢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“要是敢反抗就会被狠狠教训一顿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“我还被吊在树上过呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“我被关在储物间里三天三夜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“乡下真可怕啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这座岛上还留存着那个时代的风气呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那孩子们的命运岌岌可危啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是注定要被狠狠教训一顿了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，仔细听听大人们的对话，他们好像也不只是在生气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“我家姑娘说要和爸爸结婚呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“我儿子夸我说是全宇宙最棒的渔夫。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“嘿嘿，我家儿子每天早上都会主动去取报纸呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不知怎的就开始炫耀起孩子了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“还挺温馨的嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，确实。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之，完全感觉不到他们有多认真。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，这或许说明了岛上的大人们多少还是信任自家孩子的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“喂，啤酒怎么已经喝光了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“没有啤酒的话，喝烧酒不就行了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“说得对啊，哈哈哈哈！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，也可能他们只是想喝酒而已。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“呃～那么眼下的方针就这样吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会议结束了（虽然一半人都醉醺醺的），暂且定下来了当前的方针。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那便是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"·{1}绝对不能答应孩子们的要求。\n"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"·{1}要让他们自愿放弃占领，主动下山。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"方针就是这两点。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“那么，说服小孩子的任务，这个嘛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大人们都把目光投向了野美希。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“我觉得就交给少年团去做如何？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11734"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“少年团吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然被点到了名，野美希和其他少年团的成员都很惊讶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“年龄相近的话，孩子们会更容易把话听进去吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“那些小鬼现在激动得很，对我们这些当父母的可抗拒了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉就像是中层管理的位置啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“也想趁这个机会，看看现在的少年团有多大能耐。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“他们这么说的话就不能退让了。我们就接下这个挑战吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“嗯，是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10282"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好吧，就让我们去撩拨一下大人们已经忘记的童心吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i13294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊……我也要去吗……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“当然了。白羽也是少年团的成员啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……明明是你们非要把我算进来的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10282"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你生在了这个岛上，这就是命运。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，我也要去？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i13287"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“当然了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然……吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把我当自己人这一点让我有点高兴。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“啊，在那儿在那儿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂――！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1771"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未今天也站在屋顶上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在楼下也聚集起了一群小孩子，在打量着我们的情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不长记性，怎么又来了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我绝对不会让你们过去这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看来精神还不错啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那么，怎么办？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11727"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“先让我来谈谈看吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或许是出于少年团团长的责任感，野美希主动站了出来。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11695"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我想和你们谈谈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“没什么好谈的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11757"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“给我好好听着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11760"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“据守不出这种强硬手段，我不能表示赞同。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11757"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“提出抗议是可以的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“但如果有想提的意见，就应该通过正当程序光明正大地提出，否则就等于是承认错在自己了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说得有道理。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说得过于有道理了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以至于这根本就不是谈判，而是说教。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩C","text":"“总觉得说得太平淡了，好无聊呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“哎？无、无聊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩A","text":"“真是死脑筋啊――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“就是啊，一个劲地光长胸部。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11733"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“胸、胸部……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩C","text":"“不服气的话，就别光顾着长胸部，也长长个子啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“就是就是，胸部女――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“胸――部！胸――部！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩B","text":"“胸――部！胸――部！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孩子们这胸部二字是越喊越响亮了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“小孩子就是喜欢胸部啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“但是野美希对这种事可没什么抵抗力啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抵抗力？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11799"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“看来需要一点管教了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10117"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，她生气了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12152"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“羽依里！快拦住她！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好、好！”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一和我慌忙合力按住野美希往回拖。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11795"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“放开！放开――！让我打他们――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“快把水枪放下！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11854"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“呜呜……那些家伙……竟敢嘲笑我……呜呜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的年龄好像倒退了。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那这次换我去吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没问题吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10282"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“交给我好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍满怀自信地走向孩子们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她看起来很有自信啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“毕竟孩子们都叫她苍老师嘛。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":225,"value":["==",["v",77],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，说来确实是这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或许他们会听老师的话吧。总之期待一下。"},{"op":"goto","target":227},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎……？那是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到了件令人有些痛心的事情。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“啊，是老师！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到苍出现，孩子们有些犹豫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然他们也不想和身为老师的苍对着干吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10329"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“大人们真是太自私了呢――完全不理解小孩子的想法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10278"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“大人应该多主动理解一点小孩子才对。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“是拉拢人心战术吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12143"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“她打算这样让对方放松警惕，然后趁机攻打进去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这不就是诈骗犯的手法吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“但是啊～苍老师是粉红色的嘛～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10289"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊？粉红色是指什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“老师很好色嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10217"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，好色是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10207"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我才不好色呢！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13252"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是吗？苍其实还挺……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10220"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“连白羽都这么说――!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“等等，如果很好色的话，那老师也是大人咯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩C","text":"“确实如此呢，不会有错！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩B","text":"“大家不要上当了哦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"孩子们","text":"“好～色，好～色，好～色，好～色。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10134"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……啊……啊啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍垂头丧气地回来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10127"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呜呜……我的威严……我才……不好色啦……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10165"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“人家只是多愁善感的年纪而已――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呜哇――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍哭着跑开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话说，她竟然被小孩子弄哭了……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“苍已经败下阵来了。那么下一个是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊？我吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“加油。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13293"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那、那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她虽然是出战了，但好像并没有什么想法。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15797"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鸣濑姐也是大人。这里不允许任何大人进来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13303"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个，想请你们……让我加入。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“大人们都很狡猾。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13313"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我很理解你们的心情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13333"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“让我们一起战斗吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“她居然反水了!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？这不是计谋吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不，她是认真的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呃……啊呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未显得很困惑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩A","text":"“等一下，这很奇怪啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“哪里奇怪？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩A","text":"“白羽姐不是一直都是独来独往的吗？怎么会说想要加入我们什么的，很奇怪吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13293"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？那个，这个是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩B","text":"“对吧！就是不想要同伴所以才总是一个人的吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“她是想打入我们的队伍，想要从内部瓦解我们！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13303"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不、不是这样的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小孩子……真是残酷啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15797"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鸣濑姐。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15800"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“死开吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13309"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“咣……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽垂头丧气地退了回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看起来受到了相当大的打击。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽，你没事吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……回去了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽步履蹒跚地沿着山路往回走去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也不知该对她说些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，比想象中还难对付啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那，让我来一下子把他们搞定吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12152"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“喂！小鬼们――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突如其来的一声大喊把羽未吓了一跳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道他是要采取暴怒的强硬手段？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12146"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那个秘密基地里应该有个木箱吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12143"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“如果你们乖乖出来，可以从里面随便挑一个喜欢的玩具带走哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来是怀柔之计啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，这对小孩子可能会挺有效的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"秘密基地里传来窸窸窣窣的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大概是找到装玩具的木箱了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“这是什么？溜溜球？轴承都坏掉了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“迷你四驱车，配置也太老了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩C","text":"“木刀和双节棍……品味令人怀疑。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12143"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“……哼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一带着冷笑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“让那些小鬼们哭一场吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那可不行吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12153"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“得趁现在让他们见识一下大人的厉害！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不然长大以后肯定会很不像话！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“冷静点。大人要是动武的话，跟孩子们的隔阂只会更深。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12153"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那我就在这里脱衣服！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等，为什么会联系到这件事了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12211"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我要一直脱，在这里赖着不走，直到他们出来为止！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，原来是单纯的骚扰啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“裸体大会开始――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一开始脱衣服。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呜哇!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12078"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你这家伙，到底是哪边的啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不，我还没开枪呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12075"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“咦？那刚才是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15773"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“给我打――!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊!!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一被孩子们的一轮齐射打成了筛子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12072"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呜呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12078"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我回家去了――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"浑身湿透的良一哭着走下了山路。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1775"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这里是我们的帝国！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“对蛮不讲理的大人绝不留情!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1771"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我抬头看着屋顶上的羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那看似是一堵固若金汤的铁壁，但一定存在着破绽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过现在先……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，爬得那么高很危险哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1775"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你又想偷看内裤了是吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等，我上次也没看到啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1774"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“给我打――!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊啊啊――――――!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“干嘛？我明明单纯只是担心你而已؟!”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“今天看来是没法谈了，先撤退吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呜呜……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i63"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就这样，少年团的说服行动以失败告终了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“是吗，辛苦你了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今晚又是和镜子阿姨两个人吃晚饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明只是少了一个人，却莫名地感到寂寞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"餐点还是泡面，更是显得寂寞了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“滋溜滋溜滋溜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，果然还是这个牌子的乌冬面最好吃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨正在美味地吃着之前买好的杯装乌冬面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨不担心孩子们吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“他们又不是失踪了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11575"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不会有什么危险的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和城里不同，岛上的人大家基本都认识。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在山里遇到危险，大概也就是撞见野生动物这种事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除此之外让人担心的是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“杯装乌冬面，之前买了很多对吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“是啊，都是整箱整箱买的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那能分给我一些吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“要添饭？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定那些家伙这会儿也饿着肚子呢。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i42"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夜里的秘密基地一片寂静。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“他们已经睡了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"晚上连警卫都没有啊。这样看来到处都是破绽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果现在大人们大举进攻的话，应该很容易就能制服他们吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，那样也太不公平了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把带来的杯装乌冬面和装着热水的水壶放在路障前面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i439"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然注意到，在路障前方稍远的地方，放着一个棕色纸袋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"打开看了一眼，里面是一些零食。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么这里会有零食？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一瞬间以为是孩子们落下的，但应该不是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这大概也是谁送来的慰问品吧。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i42"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……是苍吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是小卖铺的招牌兼老师的温柔吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来大家都想到一起去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了方便孩子们找到，我把泡面跟水壶和零食摆在了一起，然后走下了山。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]